    Card Edge Connector Pinout
                                       Each connector is PCIe x16

     /~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\     4 busses: AF, AB, BF, BB
    |  <-- Top                    |
    |                             |    AF: 64-bit data bus
    |            FRONT            |    AB: Standard IN/OUT
    |                             |    BF: 64-bit data bus
    |              _              |    BB: 64-bit data bus
    `---'`--------' `---'`--------'
    \.____________/ \.____________/    PCIe x16:
     |               |
     +-> A           +-> B              - 82 pins
                                        - 0-11, KEY, 12-81

    Bus AF pinout
    =============

     # | Function   # | Function   # | Function   # | Function
    ---+---------  ---+---------  ---+---------  ---+---------
     0 | VCC       21 | GND       42 | GND       63 | GND
     1 | CLK       22 | IN 8      43 | IN 24     64 | OUT 13
     2 | GND       23 | IN 9      44 | IN 25     65 | OUT 14
     3 | !CLK      24 | IN 10     45 | IN 26     66 | OUT 15
     4 | GND       25 | IN 11     46 | IN 27     67 | GND
     5 | EN 0      26 | GND       47 | GND       68 | OUT 16
     6 | GND       27 | IN 12     48 | OUT 0     69 | OUT 17
     7 | EN 1      28 | IN 13     49 | OUT 1     70 | OUT 18
     8 | GND       29 | IN 14     50 | OUT 2     71 | OUT 19
     9 | EN 2      30 | IN 15     51 | OUT 3     72 | GND
    10 | GND       31 | GND       52 | GND       73 | OUT 20
    11 | EN 3      32 | VCC       53 | OUT 4     74 | OUT 21
    12 | IN 0      33 | IN 16     54 | OUT 5     75 | OUT 22
    13 | IN 1      34 | IN 17     55 | OUT 6     76 | OUT 23
    14 | IN 2      35 | IN 18     56 | OUT 7     77 | GND
    15 | IN 3      36 | IN 19     57 | GND       78 | OUT 24
    16 | GND       37 | GND       58 | OUT 8     79 | OUT 25
    17 | IN 4      38 | IN 20     59 | OUT 9     80 | OUT 26
    18 | IN 5      39 | IN 21     60 | OUT 10    81 | OUT 27
    19 | IN 6      40 | IN 22     61 | OUT 11       |
    20 | IN 7      41 | IN 23     62 | GND          |
